OSD/OS image: what it is made of, and under which licences
==========================================================

The OSD/OS image is OSD/OS (https://github.com/mehmetraif/OSD-OS) on
Raspberry Pi OS Lite (64-bit), which is based on Debian 13 "trixie". It is
built with Raspberry Pi's image builder, pi-gen
(https://github.com/RPi-Distro/pi-gen), at the commit os/build.sh pins:
pi-gen's stages 0 to 2, which make Raspberry Pi OS Lite, and OSD/OS's own
stage (os/stage-osdos in OSD/OS's source) on top.

On the image this file is /usr/share/doc/osdos/NOTICE.


